/ event-action: what an event runs is an event, held by the actor that bound it, in lists each goal, step and action
/ makes on its first run. This goal is the plan's index and its proof: each comment a behaviour, the test under it
/ proves it. The text is start.md.
Start
- call Stage1
- call Stage2
- call Stage3
- call Stage4
- call Stage5
- call Stage6
- call Stage7
- call Stage8
- call BoyScout

Stage1
/ on.event answers the event; on.unbind takes it off, and it no longer runs — plang test
/ /module/on/UnbindTakesTheEvent
- call /module/on/UnbindTakesTheEvent
/ the surface golden and the decider fixtures are re-pinned under this decision — C#

Stage2
/ "before each goal" and "before goal Process" both run for Process, in the order they were bound — plang test
/ /app/event/BindOrder
- call /app/event/BindOrder
/ "after each goal, call XX" then "after each goal, call YY": XX runs before YY — plang test
/ /app/event/AfterInBindOrder
- call /app/event/AfterInBindOrder
/ a goal run as the system doesn't run the user's events — plang test
/ /app/event/OtherActorDoesntSee
- call /app/event/OtherActorDoesntSee
/ an app's "before each goal" doesn't run for a system/ goal — plang test
/ /app/event/SystemGoalsLeftAlone
- call /app/event/SystemGoalsLeftAlone
/ "after llm.query" runs for each llm.query step — plang test
/ /app/event/AfterEachLlmQuery
- call /app/event/AfterEachLlmQuery
/ an event bound after a goal's first run joins its list and runs at its next start — plang test
/ /app/event/LateEventJoins
- call /app/event/LateEventJoins
/ %!app.event% lists the running actor's events — plang test
/ /app/event/ListsTheActorsEvents
- call /app/event/ListsTheActorsEvents
/ an event bound after %count% is set runs after each set of the variable %count% — plang test
/ /app/variable/SetRunsItsEvent
- call /app/variable/SetRunsItsEvent
/ "before each goal in api/*" runs for the goals in the api/ folder beside the goal, not for one outside it — plang test
/ /app/goal/pattern/NamesAFolder
- call /app/goal/pattern/NamesAFolder
/ "before each file action" runs for the file save and the file read, not for a write out — plang test
/ /app/module/EachFileAction
- call /app/module/EachFileAction

Stage3
/ on a cache hit the app's before events still ran — C#
/ "on error ignore" never puts an empty result in the cache — C#
/ the step's own "on error" takes a failure before the app's "on error" event sees it — C#

Stage4
/ the debug watch, the test runner's timing, coverage and a mock each still run, and none is in a snapshot — C#

Stage5
/ the os's /system/event/Hello.goal event fires in an app, and not with event.setting.system=skip — C#
/ SystemEventsTests.TheAppsSystemEvent_RunsAtItsStart, SystemEventsTests.UnderSkip_NoSystemEventLoads
/ an app's own system/event/Hello.goal replaces the os's: only the app's fires — C#
/ SystemEventsTests.ASubAppsOwnSystemEvent_ReplacesTheOneItsMakerBoundFromTheFileOfThatName,
/ SystemEventsTests.ASubAppOverItsMakersFolder_RunsNoSystemEventFile_AndHasTheMakersEvents

Stage6
/ an event bound with Sub=none doesn't run in a sub app; one bound without it does — C#
/ SavedBindingsTests.ASubApp_TakesInAnEvent_AsItsSubSays_AndItsOwnSubAppFollows
/ a snapshot keeps an event's Sub, and a resumed app's sub app honours it — C#
/ SavedBindingsTests.ASnapshot_KeepsSub_AndTheResumedEventAnswersTheSame

Stage7
/ "return false, 2 levels" ends two goals, and the caller of the second goes on — C#
/ TaskTests.AReturnOfTwoLevels_EndsItsGoalAndItsCaller_TheNextGoesOnWithTheValue
/ a parent app's goal call goes up the link with its parameters — C#
/ TaskTests.AParentGoalsCall_SendsItsParametersUp, TaskTests.AParentGoal_RunsNoneOfTheCallersGoalEvents_ItsGoalCallStillRunsThem

Stage8
/ a platform's event calls Meter, Meter calls Record: inside an uploaded sub app with its own Record.goal, the
/ platform's Record runs — C#
/ CallFindsItsAppTests.APlatformsMeter_InAnUploadedSubApp_CallsThePlatformsRecord,
/ CallFindsItsAppTests.APlatformsMeter_InItsOwnSystemFolder_StillCallsThePlatformsRecord
/ an app's own system/…/Record.goal still replaces the os's for an os goal's call — C#
/ CallFindsItsAppTests.AnAppsOwnSystemGoal_ReplacesTheOss, CallFindsItsAppTests.AnOsGoalsCall_InASubApp_FindsTheSubAppsOwnSystemCopy
/ an upload can't escape or swallow its maker's checks: its system/ goals are checked, its own system/event/ joins after its maker's,
/ and its on error never takes a failure its maker's event raised — C#
/ SubOwnEventsProbeTests B2, E and B4
/ a sub app's own system/event/Hello.goal replaces only the inherited Hello — C#

BoyScout
/ after on.unbind takes the last event off an item, %!app.event% no longer lists that item — C#
/ two events made by one on.event step both run after a resume — C#
